        "original_id": "81ea2e1d-c8ef-5173-8692-bb8c35fb1da0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paddy Breathnach, Allen Leech\n- Films: Man About Dog, Cowboys & Angels\n- Companies: Redbus Film Distribution, HBO\n- TV Series: Rome\n- Awards: Irish Film & Television Awards\n- Productions: A Streetcar Named Desire\n- Roles: Vincent Cusack, Mo Chara, Marcus Agrippa\n\nFacts:\n- Paddy Breathnach directed the film \"Man About Dog,\" and Redbus Film Distribution distributed it.\n- In 1998, Allen Leech made his professional acting debut with a small part in a production of \"A Streetcar Named Desire.\"\n- In 2004, Allen Leech earned an Irish Film & Television Awards nomination for his performance as Mo Chara in \"Man About Dog.\"\n- Allen Leech made his first major film appearance as Vincent Cusack in \"Cowboys & Angels.\"\n- Allen Leech played Marcus Agrippa on the HBO historical drama series \"Rome.\"",
